Ooh, clever, but not quite. I was able to reproduce this, but I did it a
little differently. (Nethack 3.4.3, for those keeping score.) If you wish
for a bear trap in wiz mode, it gets generated as a hidden trap on the spot
that you're standing on. Your player isn't aware of it. It's considered as if
it were generated as part of the level, and not as something you made, so
the shk will follow normal monster rules and avoid stepping on it. However,
if you wish for a bear trap outside, untrap it, and then set it up on the
spot you illustrated, the shk will confiscate it. So, this isn't possible
in a normal game. Plus the Kops appear regardless.


